description:
About the job

We are looking for a skilled marketing specialist to execute and adapt marketing initiatives for the Nepal market. In this role, you will focus on launching and managing local campaigns, ensuring they resonate with the audience and deliver strong results.




We need someone who understands local consumer behavior, knows how to leverage the right channels, and can bring creative marketing ideas to reality. Strong knowledge of the Nepal market and fluency in the language are essential for success in this role.




Responsibilities:

Work with marketing HQ team to map out the tasks needed to implement our strategy;
Collaborate with cross-functional teams: production, SMM, CRM, creative;
Maintain an up-to-date understanding of the company, its products, and its client base to implement effective marketing campaigns;
Manage and supervise marketing projects from beginning to end;
Develop and maintain strong working relationships with external stakeholders.




Requirements:

3+ year relevant experience with different scope of projects in the marketing field;
Excellent organizational, prioritization, and decision-making skills;
Good communication, interpersonal, and leadership skills;
Experience working in the agency would be a great advantage.




*The terms of cooperation with companies of the Yango group or its partners may vary from those indicated on the website; please check with the recruiter for details.

About the job

About Bybit,




Established in March 2018, Bybit is one of the fastest growing cryptocurrency derivatives exchanges, with more than 70 million registered users. We offer a professional platform where crypto traders can find an ultra-fast matching engine, excellent customer service and multilingual community support. We provide innovative online spot and derivatives trading services, mining and staking products, as well as API support, to retail and institutional clients around the world, and strive to be the most reliable exchange for the emerging digital asset class.




Our core values define us. We listen, care, and improve to create a faster, fairer, and more humane trading environment for our users. Our innovative, highly advanced, user-friendly platform has been designed from the ground-up using best-in-class infrastructure to provide our users with the industry's safest, fastest, fairest, and most transparent trading experience. Built on customer-centric values, we endeavour to provide professional, 24/7 multi-language customer support to help in a timely manner.




As of today, Bybit is one of the most trusted, reliable, and transparent cryptocurrency derivatives platforms in space.




Job Responsibilities：

Assist product managers to sort out compliance business processes, such as KYC/AML, transaction monitoring, user identity verification and other modules; 
Cooperate with research and analysis of regulatory requirements in various countries, and assist in the output of functional requirement documents and data burying documents; 
Assist to follow up the product development and testing process, push the function online and track the effect; 
Participate in the collaborative communication between risk control/legal/compliance departments to optimize the compliance experience between users and the system; 
Pay attention to the latest regulatory developments in the industry, and conduct comparative analysis of compliance products on mainstream platforms 




Job Requirements ：

Interested in financial technology, blockchain, encryption compliance, and strong logical thinking ability; 
Proficient in using tools such as Excel, PPT, Notion or Figma, and basic data analysis capabilities are preferred; 
English can be used as the working language, good written ability in both Chinese and English
